<blockquote>
<p>and had not travelled more than 1000 feet above sea level in the 12 months preceding his death.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This makes it sound like he became afraid of mountains because he remembered the encounter. Did the Foundation not dose him with amnesiacs?</p>

